==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Shining Fates|Eldegoss|15}} from the {{TCG|Shining Fates}} expansion.
*'''Float Up''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Eldegoss V|19}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

